[/tikz]
Each corner square has side $4.8-2.4-1.2=1.2\text{ m}$.
$A=4.8\times4.8-4\times(1.2\times1.2)$
$=23.04-4\times1.44$
$=23.04-5.76$
$=17.28\text{ m}^2$"
