An L-shaped paved area is laid inside a rectangular courtyard.
All angles are right angles.
Calculate the area of the courtyard that is **not** paved, in $\text{m}^2$.",
        "structure": "subtract-interior-hole",
        "solution_text": "[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.25]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (18,12);
\draw (3,2) -- (11,2) node[midway,below,font=\small] {$8\text{ m}$};
