      "solution_text": "$A=5\\times5-4\\times(1.5\\times1.5)$\n$=25-4\\times2.25$\n$=25-9$\n$=16\\text{ m}^2$"
    },
    {
      "id": "dq-34487",
      "question_text": "What is the area of this L-shaped room in $\\text{m}^2$?\nIts outside dimensions are $300\\text{ cm}$ high and $110\\text{ cm}$ wide at the upper section; the lower section extends $2.5\\text{ m}$ beyond it and is $1\\text{ m}$ high.",
