\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Find the area of the triangle.",
    "solution_text": "The base is $11\text{ cm}$. The height at a right angle to that base is $4\text{ cm}$. The slanted $5\text{ cm}$ side is not needed.
$\text{Area}=11\times4\div2$
$=44\div2$
$=22\text{ cm}^{2}$"
  },
  {
    "question_text": "[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.341,every node/.style={font=\normalsize}]
