Two copies of a triangle make this parallelogram. Its base is $13\text{ cm}$ and its height is $6\text{ cm}$. Explain how to find the area of one triangle.",
    "solution_text": "Turn one copy around and join it to the other copy. The two equal triangles fill the parallelogram.
