The difference is $12\text{ m}^{2}$. Each smaller triangle uses its own base and the common perpendicular height."
  },
  {
    "question_text": "A triangular garden has base $11\text{ m}$ and perpendicular height $4\text{ m}$. Soil costs $\$13$ per square metre. Find the cost.",
